[h1] Hello, Evil Defenders! [/h1]

Hope you enjoy the game and will enjoy it even more with this update which includes:
[list]
    [*]Fixed a bug with Leaderboards;
    [*]Fixed a bug where the Ability is not canceled when you press the right mouse button;
    [*]Achievement "Scholar" is now counted correctly;
    [*]To achieve "Annihilator" now you need to kill 150000 enemies, not 1000000;
    [*]Minor localization corrections.
[/list]

